  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Sector Reform</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Reforma del Sector Financiero</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM INCLUDES REFORMS ORIENTED TOWARD (1) PRIVATIZING STATE COMMERCIAL BANKING, RESTRUCTURING BANCO DE LA NACION, AND RESTRUCTURING DEVELOPMENT BANKING; (2) UPGRADING PRUDENTIAL REGULATIONS AND THE SUPERVISION OF THE BANKING REGULATORY BOARD; AND (3) REVISING AND REORGANIZING THE CENTRAL BANK CHARTE..</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
